OL,3,GNEWSAPeople's Palace revamp gets #14m
OL,4,Agovernment boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong-running efforts to reopen one of
OL,7,FGlasgow's most famous museums have
OL,8,Freceived a welcome boost.
OL,10,FThe People's Palace closed in April
OL,11,F2024 for a #36m upgrade and the
OL,12,Fattached Winter Gardens, a large glass
OL,13,Fconservatory, has been closed since
OL,14,F2019.
OL,16,FIt had been hoped the attraction would
OL,17,Fbe back in public use by 2027, but
OL,18,Fearlier this year the project was
OL,19,Fdelayed indefinitely.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
